      "writtenOn": "2021-08-30T20:01:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The issue here is when the binder dies and then unlinkToDeath is called on it. In this case noi would still need to be removed from mNetworkOffers to ensure that list is updated with only the active networkOffers.",
