      "writtenOn": "2021-08-31T03:28:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Correct, but remove() only gets called from handleUnregisterNetworkOffer(). When handleUnregisterNetworkOffer() is called after a binder has already died remove() will return true since mNetworkOffers still contains the noi of the killed binder. Then unlinkToDeath() will throw an exception since the binder is dead already.",
